  qrCodeID: "Yard\u0131mc\u0131 Topraklama Kablosu"
  title: "Yard\u0131mc\u0131 Topraklama Kablosu"
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a19aaadcf7844142a73ce60950ec353, type: 3}
  message: "Yard\u0131mc\u0131 topraklama kablosu, y\xFCksek gerilim testleri s\u0131ras\u0131nda
    g\xFCvenli referans topraklamas\u0131 olu\u015Fturmak amac\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r.
    Ara\xE7 ile ana topraklama sistemi aras\u0131nda ba\u011Flant\u0131 kurarak t\xFCm
    topraklama noktalar\u0131n\u0131n ayn\u0131 elektriksel potansiyelde kalmas\u0131n\u0131
    sa\u011Flar. Bu sayede gerilim farklar\u0131ndan kaynaklanabilecek riskler azalt\u0131l\u0131r
    ve test \xF6ncesinde g\xFCvenli enerji kontrol\xFC yap\u0131lmas\u0131na yard\u0131mc\u0131
    olur. Sistemin do\u011Fru ve g\xFCvenli \u015Fekilde \xE7al\u0131\u015Fabilmesi
    i\xE7in \xF6nemli bir g\xFCvenlik bile\u015Fenidir."
